{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 33, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant culture and stunning landscapes. My first stop was Tokyo, where I marveled at the towering skyscrapers and bustling streets of Shibuya. I spent hours exploring the city's many neighborhoods, sampling delicious street food and shopping for unique souvenirs.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was a visit to the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I watched the early morning tuna auction and sampled the freshest sushi of my life. I also took a day trip to the nearby city of Nikko, where I hiked through the beautiful mountains and visited the ornate Toshogu Shrine.\n\nAs I traveled throughout Japan, I was struck by the country's rich history and tradition. From the serene gardens of Kyoto to the historic temples of Nara, every stop was a chance to learn something new and experience the country's unique culture. I was also impressed by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people, who went out of their way to make me feel welcome.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with memories and inspiration that will last a lifetime. Whether you're a foodie, a history buff, or simply looking for a new and exciting destination, Japan has something to offer. I highly recommend adding it to your travel bucket list.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0041772969998419285}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -1.5043978691101074}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0013331820955500007}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.160275593400001